dsh-wtskin-project README · 快速开始：```text
dsh_wtskin_project  dir=D:/skins/q5l action=create data={"quadScale":2.56,"width":4096,"height":4096}
dsh_wtskin_measure  dir=D:/skins/q5l id=wing_u scale=2.56

dsh-wtskin-project README · 打开返回的 URL，量完点「保存到工程」：dsh_wtskin_layer    dir=D:/skins/q5l action=update id=wing_u layer={"image":"p8.png","size":"chord","factor":1.3,"rotate180":true}
dsh_wtskin_export   dir=D:/skins/q5l
```

